kaptan (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * System tray icon with page shortcuts; closing the window can keep Kaptan
    running in the tray (asks first, like Stacer). Autostart starts hidden.
  * Dashboard: fan speeds, thicker gauges, all-disks dialog from the DISK
    gauge, steady download/upload cards.
  * Settings: sidebar with icons and text or icons only, larger icons,
    GPU usage alert, close behaviour.
  * System Cleaner: Stacer's category icons and application icons.
  * Uninstaller shows what apt will really remove before uninstalling.
  * Debian packaging: man page, copyright, runtime library dependencies.

 -- os <4129330+ortancasamuray@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:13:47 +0300

kaptan (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Rust + Slint port of Stacer.
  * Dashboard, resources, processes, startup apps, services, uninstaller,
    system cleaner, search, hosts, APT repositories, GNOME settings.
  * GPU usage monitoring and alerts (AMD sysfs, NVIDIA nvidia-smi).
  * English and Turkish user interface.

